      "task_item": "",
      "content": "\n## Issue\nWhen creating a subtask in ChatView.vue, the new subtask should inherit `project_id` and `profiles` from the parent task, but currently it does not.\n\n## Requirements\n- Subtask creation must copy `project_id` from parent task\n- Subtask creation must copy `profiles` from parent task\n- Maintain parent-child relationship for these attributes\n- Ensure data is passed correctly to subtask component\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\u2713 New subtasks inherit parent project_id\n\u2713 New subtasks inherit parent profiles\n\u2713 Child tasks properly reference parent task\n\u2713 Data inheritance works across component hierarchy",
